{
"source": "Wraith: The Oblivion 20th Anniversary Edition, Chapter Five (pp. 149–219). Codes and one-line summaries in WoDX's own words; read the page for the full system.",
"general": {
"pool": "An Attribute + the Arcanos rating; most arts cost Pathos, some Corpus or Willpower; coercive or destructive arts can feed the Shadow Angst (p. 149).",
"defaults": {
"Argos": "6; −Fetter rating travelling to a Fetter (min 4); +1 a passenger without Argos (p. 151)",
"Castigate": "the Shadow's permanent Angst or the wraith's Willpower, the higher (p. 155)",
"Embody": "the local Shroud; −3 with a consort (p. 159)",
"Fatalism": "6 on the same side, the Shroud across it (p. 163)",
"Flux": "the local Shroud (p. 168)",
"Inhabit": "6; −2 attuned (p. 173)",
"Intimation": "the target's Willpower (p. 177)",
"Keening": "as each art",
"Lifeweb": "the Shroud at the Fetter (Shadowlands 7, Tempest 8, Labyrinth 9) (p. 185)",
"Mnemosynis": "6 on herself; the target's Willpower (or the Shroud, the higher, across it) (p. 190)",
"Moliate": "as each art; failure backfires (p. 195)",
"Outrage": "the Shroud across it; 7 Shadowlands, 6 Tempest, 5 Labyrinth (+1 Angst there) (p. 199)",
"Pandemonium": "the Shroud across it; 6 in Stygia and the Tempest, each 1 rolled a temporary Angst (p. 204)",
"Phantasm": "the Shroud across it; the target's Willpower in the Underworld (p. 209)",
"Puppetry": "the local Shroud; the host resists with Willpower (p. 213)",
"Usury": "6; needs touch (p. 216)"
}
},
